  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Freiwilliger Beitrag zum Jount UNDP-DPPA Programme on Building National Capacities for Conflict Prevention</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary contribution to the Joint UNDP-DPPA Programme on Building National Capacities for Conflict Prevention</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Das Programm unterst&#xfc;tzt Konfliktpr&#xe4;vention in zahlreichen L&#xe4;ndern, vornehmlich durch die Entsendung und Unterst&#xfc;tzung von Peace and Development Advisors (PDAs) der VN. Damit leistet das Programm einen entscheidenen Beitrag zur Stabilisierung von Konfliktregionen. Die Einzahlung erfolgt in das UNDP Funding Window &quot;Governance, Peacebuilding, Crisis and Resilience&quot; mit o.g. Zweckbindung.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programe supports conflict prevention in numerous countries worldwide, primarily through the deployment and work of UN Peace and Development Advisors (PDAs). In this way, the programme also contributes to the stabilization of conflict regions. Germany supports this programme through a contribution to the UNDP Funding Window &quot;Governance, Peacebuilding, Crisis and Resilience&quot; with above-mentioned earmarking.</narrative>
  </description>
